{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"case.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.1.0","title":"二分搜索首次匹配","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"kind":"algorithm","learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":["1.0.1"],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.binary-search","version":"1.0.0"}],"relatedLessonRefs":[{"id":"lesson.c.array-sum","version":"1.1.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"},"teaching":{"objectives":["在非递减数组中找首次0基下标"],"explanation":"数组必须非递减，手动乱序会被拒绝。使用闭区间[left,right]与中点left+(right-left)/2；遇到目标先记下位置，再到左侧找更早匹配。默认[-2,0,0,4,8]查0得到0基下标1；未找到和空数组都返回-1，输出后换行。不能遇到相等就立即返回中点。","exampleProgramRefs":[{"id":"program.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0"}],"commonMistakes":["手动乱序被静默排序","重复命中返回任意位置"],"boundaryNotes":["空/未命中输出-1和换行","首尾/重复/范围外；n最多30"],"source":{"document":"content/c/p0/README.md","locator":"case.c.binary-search-first；项目原创；沿用08.4已验证程序"}},"resultRule":"binary-first-index","rewardRef":{"id":"reward.case.first-view","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.binary-search-first","version":"1.0.0","title":"首次匹配二分参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.sorted-search","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[-2,0,0,4,8],"target":0},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 5;\n    int values[5] = {-2, 0, 0, 4, 8};\n    int target = 0;\n    int left = 0;\n    int right = n - 1;\n    int answer = -1;\n    while (left <= right) {\n        int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n        if (values[mid] >= target) {\n            if (values[mid] == target) {\n                answer = mid;\n            }\n            right = mid - 1;\n        } else {\n            left = mid + 1;\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", answer);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"values","targetName":"n","targetKind":"logical-length","from":"length-of"},{"bindingKey":"param.values","inputKey":"values","targetName":"values","targetKind":"array","from":"field","emptyStorage":"one-zero-placeholder"},{"bindingKey":"param.target","inputKey":"target","targetName":"target","targetKind":"scalar","from":"field"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.if","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.while","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.unary","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"../架构决策/01.3-正反样例清单.md","locator":"REF-10"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.sorted-search","version":"1.0.0","title":"有序数组和目标","fields":[{"key":"values","kind":"sequence","min":-999,"max":999,"minItems":0,"maxItems":30},{"key":"target","kind":"integer","min":-999,"max":999}],"relations":[{"kind":"length-of","field":"values","target":"n"},{"kind":"nondecreasing","field":"values"}]}}